  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary low-top Nike Dunk silhouette\nGenuine leather upper ages gracefully with time for a vintage aesthetic\nEmbossed Baroque-style embellishments with golden heel stitching add an artisan touch\nPerforated toe box increases ventilation\nPadded tongue and a low-top collar with signature Nike branding\nClassic lace-up closure with two sets of laces secures the fit\nFoam midsole offers lightweight, responsive cushioningRubber outsole with classic hoops pivot circle adds durability and reliable traction across all surfaces\nThe Nike Dunk Low SE is imported.\nLean into a more grandeur look when you lace up these Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes. Crafted from gracefully aging genuine leather, this iteration of the Dunk features elegant, earthy tones and is embossed with Baroque-style embellishments for an artsy aesthetic that belongs behind museum glass.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Dunk Low SE Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sail/Fauna Brown/Sail/Metallic Gold</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3289744</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n 